#: ../../tools/migrations/overview.rst:233
msgid ""
"**Services: Migrations** requires that the user also has access to both "
"the source Cloud (VMware) and the target Cluster (HVM). Cloud and Group "
"access are controlled via the role's Cloud and Group permission tabs."
